prop hopper beh.use=Empty the hopper
prop hopper if.use=signal|milling\n!signal|seal1
prop hopper on.use=message||The stones grind, the hopper shakes empty - and out of the chute with the old grain falls a black stone with a gold stag on it. The first royal seal.\nsignal||seal1\ngive||story:seal*1\nsound||event:/exploring/utopia/metal_pickup
prop hopper else.use=message||The hopper is jammed full. The mill must turn first - the miller's ledger says how.
