prop forestlock beh.use=Unlock the forest gate
prop forestlock if.use=has|story:forestkey|1\nstate|forestgatedoor|closed
prop forestlock on.use=message||The farm's key turns. The bamboo gate sinks and the dark of the forest breathes out.\nopen|forestgatedoor\nsound||event:/exploring/utopia/door_entrance_open
prop forestlock else.use=message||The forest gate. Only the farm keeps its key.
