prop winch if.use=state|portcullis|closed
prop winch on.use=message||The winch clanks round and round; the portcullis rises into the gatehouse.\nopen|portcullis\nsound||event:/exploring/temperence/selene/handle_spin
prop winch else.use=message||The portcullis is up.
