quest title=The Empty Throne
quest intro=A kingdom emptied, its crown hidden, its throne bare. The herald's proclamation is on the market cross by the harbour.
# Chapter 1 - the harbour town
step reach|harbour|1|Land at the harbour of Elderhaven
step read|The herald's proclamation|1|Read the herald's proclamation on the market cross
step kill|Tangaroa rat|4|Clear the rats out of the warehouse on the quay
step open|Guildhall chest|1|Take the reeve's writ from the guildhall's chest
step catch|Chicken|3|Catch the market's runaway hens (the poulterer's crate has a net launcher)
step open|Innkeeper's thanks|1|Open the innkeeper's chest for her thanks - and her gossip
step reach|tollbridge|1|Show the writ at the toll and cross the river bridge
# Chapter 2 - the farmlands
step reach|mill|1|Walk up the river road to the watermill
step read|The miller's ledger|1|Read the miller's ledger
step collect|story:seal|1|Open the mill race, let the wheel turn and empty the hopper for the first seal
step kill|Warthog|4|Drive the boars out of the barley
step catch|Goat|3|Bring in the farmer's three goats
step collect|story:forestkey|1|Take the forest gate's key from the farmer's chest
step reach|forestgate|1|Unlock the gate in the palisade and enter the dark forest
# Chapter 3 - the dark forest
step read|The woodcutter's warning|1|Read the warning on the woodcutter's door
step kill|Hyena|3|Fight off the wolves in the clearing
step reach|hermithut|1|Find the hermit's hut in the deepest wood
step read|The hermit's riddle|1|Read the hermit's riddle
step collect|story:seal|2|Find the right hollow oak in the glade for the second seal
step kill|Bear|1|Face the old bear of the glade
step reach|forestshrine|1|Go on to the forest shrine on the south edge
# Chapter 4 - the lake
step reach|lakeshore|1|Go down to the ferryman's landing on the lake
step read|The ferryman's chart|1|Read the ferryman's chart
step reach|drownedchapel|1|Dive to the drowned chapel (air under its roof)
step kill|Angler fish|1|Face the lake's great pike
step collect|story:seal|3|Take the third seal from the chapel's reliquary
step reach|castlepath|1|Swim or punt across to the castle road's foot
# Chapter 5 - the castle
step reach|castlegate|1|Climb the castle road to the gate
step read|The steward's confession|1|Wind up the portcullis and read the steward's confession in the court
step kill|Rat|4|Clear the rats out of the castle kitchens
step reach|vaultstair|1|Go down the stair to the crown vault
step collect|story:crown|1|Set the three seals in the locks and take the crown
step kill|Mama bear|1|Face the Beast of Elderhaven in the great hall
step reach|throneroom|1|Climb the great stair to the throne room
# Chapter 6 - the coronation
step read|King Aldric's will|1|Read King Aldric's will on the throne
step collect|story:royalseal|1|Set the crown on the empty throne
step reach|battlements|1|Show yourself on the battlements
step read|The royal charter|1|Read the royal charter on the lectern
step open|The royal treasury|1|Open the royal treasury behind the throne
step open|The people's gift|1|Go down to the market cross for the people's gift
quest done=The crown is on the throne, the bells ring from castle to harbour, and far over the sea, boats are already turning for home. Elderhaven has its keeper.
quest reward=TitaniumIngot*3;MetalIngot*6;Cooked_GenericMeat*4;Rope*6

save The Last Kingdom
